---
title: 'Scrollbar Test'
---

## Scrollbar wheel

1. Hold `shift` and scroll the mouse wheel on the series area.
2. Hold `shift` and scroll the mouse wheel on the x-axis.
3. Hold `shift` and scroll the mouse wheel on the x-axis scrollbar track and thumb.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Scrollbar" name="scrollbar-wheel" type="generated" /%}

## Scrollbar with crossAt

1. Cursor should change to `ns-resize` when hovering over the y-axis
2. Cursor should revert to `default` when hovering over the series marker that overlaps the y-axis.
3. Drag the y-axis to zoom in.
4. Drag the series area to pan, cursor should change to `grabbing`.
5. Drag the y-axis scrollbar to pan, cursor should remain as `default`.
6. Confirm cursors are still correct in steps 1. and 2.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Scrollbar with crossAt" name="scrollbar-cross-at" type="generated" /%}
